<b>Enter Passcode</b>

17:37.330 --> 17:38.880
<b>Take a Look at Reality, Idiot
28K subscribers</b>

17:38.960 --> 17:40.670
Thanks so much!

17:44.630 --> 17:46.040
You! Why do you have that?!

17:48.920 --> 17:50.460
You're kidding, right?

17:51.170 --> 17:54.380
LookIdiot.... was you, Mero?

17:59.040 --> 18:02.330
You should be thanking me.
Now we get to sing as the final act.

18:04.250 --> 18:05.080
<b>Patuan</b>

18:04.250 --> 18:05.080
<b>#RainbowGirls</b>

18:04.250 --> 18:05.080
<b>Power Kid
What... Why...?</b>

18:04.250 --> 18:05.080
<b>#RainbowGirls</b>

18:04.260 --> 18:05.080
<b>What am I supposed to look forward
to in life starting tomorrow?</b>

18:04.260 --> 18:05.080
<b>#RainbowGirls</b>

18:04.260 --> 18:05.080
<b>Nekonoyama
I need to lie down now</b>

18:04.260 --> 18:05.080
<b>#RainbowGirls</b>

18:04.260 --> 18:05.080
<b>Vagabond Type A
This can't be happening...right...???</b>

18:14.040 --> 18:14.960
What's going on?

18:14.960 --> 18:16.580
Apparently Nonoka punched Mero.

18:16.880 --> 18:18.580
Oh no, is she okay?

18:17.170 --> 18:18.080
Actually?

18:19.290 --> 18:20.750
This'll go viral for sure.

18:20.290 --> 18:21.460
What's all this?

18:38.130 --> 18:39.880
What? She resorted to violence?

18:39.880 --> 18:43.920
But isn't this Nonoka's fault?!
Why do we have to go on hiatus too?!

18:44.330 --> 18:47.250
Did you have issues with Mero Setou from before?!

18:47.460 --> 18:48.210
That hurt.

18:48.790 --> 18:50.630
I never thought Nonoka would do such a thing.

18:50.880 --> 18:52.540
Nono-tan, it's not true, is it?!

18:53.250 --> 18:55.710
So you want to get in my way, Nonoka.

19:01.500 --> 19:07.330
The sea at night... with no end in sight.

19:07.790 --> 19:12.790
My colors are still small.

19:13.380 --> 19:17.710
Someday, someday...

19:18.750 --> 19:24.500
...please may someone notice.

19:28.040 --> 19:30.250
Okay, then let's hear everyone's progress.

19:30.250 --> 19:33.460
First of all, lyrics. It's mostly all done except for the title!

19:33.460 --> 19:34.540
Okay, then going on-

19:34.540 --> 19:35.670
Hey, Kano.

19:35.670 --> 19:36.250
Hmm?

19:36.630 --> 19:38.210
Yeah? What's up, Mahiru?

19:39.290 --> 19:42.710
Sorry, there's something I have to tell all of you.

19:43.210 --> 19:44.130
...Yeah?

19:44.580 --> 19:50.170
You know how I told you the other day that
Ms. Yukine wants me to provide art for the Sundolls?

19:52.420 --> 19:53.420
I'm really sorry.

19:54.040 --> 19:57.210
But I've decided that I really want to take it on.

19:59.710 --> 20:01.630
Huh? Then...

20:02.040 --> 20:03.710
...what about our music video?

20:04.290 --> 20:07.040
The timing overlaps almost completely, so...

20:07.380 --> 20:09.710
Wait! But we promised, right?

20:10.380 --> 20:13.130
That we wanted to release a big one on New Year's Eve?

20:13.130 --> 20:16.040
I'm really sorry. But I really want to try this.

20:17.290 --> 20:20.420
I want to challenge myself, on the big stage!

20:21.670 --> 20:22.500
Why, though?!

20:23.040 --> 20:27.920
Before I met you Kano, I used to hate myself.

20:28.710 --> 20:35.670
But now... I've grown to like myself,
at least when I'm drawing.

20:35.880 --> 20:40.670
Then you can just draw with JELEE!
Wasn't the past year fun for you at all?

20:40.880 --> 20:43.790
It WAS fun! So much fun!

20:44.630 --> 20:46.540
But... that's not it.

20:46.750 --> 20:47.670
What's not it?!

20:48.290 --> 20:50.790
It was fun, and that's why.

20:52.830 --> 20:55.790
I want to get so much better!

20:56.500 --> 21:01.540
Because I want to grow to love my art...
and myself... properly for once!

21:02.710 --> 21:08.790
Uh, it's okay, Kano. We can just make
our music video as soon as this job is over.

21:09.290 --> 21:10.920
That's right, next year we can-

21:10.920 --> 21:12.540
That's not the issue here!

21:15.830 --> 21:18.580
You all... leave me in the end.

21:18.790 --> 21:19.460
Huh?

21:20.630 --> 21:25.880
You said you would draw for my sake,
but you're going to draw for her anyway!

21:25.880 --> 21:27.210
When it comes down to it!

21:27.210 --> 21:28.880
Liar! LIAR!

21:29.080 --> 21:30.540
H-hey, Kano.

21:30.540 --> 21:35.040
Without me, you wouldn't
be drawing right now. Am I wrong?!

21:35.500 --> 21:39.000
Mahiru... Yoru, you're just a jellyfish
who can't swim, aren't you?!

21:43.460 --> 21:46.290
That's what you thought about me?

21:52.960 --> 21:59.330
The sea at night... with no end in sight.

22:00.290 --> 22:05.330
My colors are still small.

22:06.420 --> 22:10.710
Someday... someday...

22:11.580 --> 22:17.960
...please may someone notice...

22:19.960 --> 22:25.170
<b>We reached 100K followers!
We reached 100K followers thanks to your
support! We're so lucky to be cheered on by
so many fans.
We're going to try real hard to bring you new
stuff, so we hope you'll stick with us!</b>

22:19.960 --> 22:25.170
<b>#JELEE</b>

22:21.080 --> 22:23.880
Why do I want to sing?

22:26.710 --> 22:28.250
100k fans, huh?

22:29.790 --> 22:30.830
I see.

22:32.290 --> 22:34.330
So the one my mom noticed...

22:34.830 --> 22:36.540
...was Mahiru.

22:39.040 --> 22:41.210
Don't go defiling that mural I love!

22:41.830 --> 22:43.330
I'm a HUGE fan!

22:43.920 --> 22:45.670
I saw that mural and it was love at first sight!

22:45.670 --> 22:47.040
It's because of you, Yoru!

22:47.040 --> 22:51.920
See, I'm gonna get back at everyone
who made fun of me with my singing!

22:52.170 --> 22:53.250
I've got a great idea!

22:53.250 --> 22:56.250
Don't you think your art coupled
with JELEE would be just the best?

22:56.630 --> 22:58.580
What if we collaborate, Yoru?!

23:00.170 --> 23:01.170
Yoru.

23:01.420 --> 23:03.880
I really love your art, Yoru.

23:05.210 --> 23:06.000
Yoru!

23:06.000 --> 23:09.250
I want to sing in front of your jellyfish, Yoru.

23:09.500 --> 23:11.960
Yoru!

23:13.580 --> 23:14.210
Yoru!

23:14.460 --> 23:16.960
So Yoru, say you'll draw for me!

23:17.080 --> 23:18.420
Yoru!

23:18.500 --> 23:19.330
Yoru!

23:19.580 --> 23:20.250
Yoru...

23:20.250 --> 23:20.790
Yoru!

23:21.000 --> 23:21.210
Yoru.

23:21.210 --> 23:21.380
Yoru.

23:21.380 --> 23:21.750
Yoru...

23:21.750 --> 23:22.000
Yoru.

23:22.000 --> 23:22.380
Yoru.

23:22.540 --> 23:23.210
Yoru...

23:24.250 --> 23:24.960
Yoru!

23:25.130 --> 23:25.920
Yoru!

23:26.710 --> 23:27.170
Yoru.

23:27.330 --> 23:27.830
Yoru.

23:28.750 --> 23:31.080
I think it was to ride with you on the back, Mahiru!

23:31.920 --> 23:35.830
All right! Then what kind of song should we make next?

23:36.330 --> 23:39.080
Let's go all out, with lots of your art!
